"tags": []}, {"author": "Toshihito Kikuchi \u003ctkikuchi@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1601905 - Add quotes for a path including whitespaces in ShellExecuteWithIFile.  r=aklotz a=request-by-mkmelin on THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH\n\nA fix for Bug 1588975 replaced the call to `LaunchWithIProcess` in\n`nsMIMEInfoWin::LaunchWithFile` with the call to `ShellExecuteWithIFile` to use\n`mozilla::ShellExecuteByExplorer`.  This caused a regression that if a filepath\ncontains whitespaces, we pass it to a target application without quoting it\nwhile the old codepath `ShellExecuteWithIFile` quoted a path accordingly in\n`assembleCmdLine`.\n\nA proposed fix is to quote a path in the same way as `assembleCmdLine` does.\nThis patch also moves `assembleCmdLine` to an exported header so that we can add\na unittest to cover both of `assembleCmdLine` and a new function\n`assembleSingleArgument.  It would be better to refactor these functions in the\nfuture because many lines are duplicated.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D56646", "files": ["toolkit/xre/AssembleCmdLine.h", "toolkit/xre/moz.build", "toolkit/xre/test/gtest/TestAssembleCommandLineWin.cpp", "toolkit/xre/test/gtest/moz.build", "uriloader/exthandler/win/nsMIMEInfoWin.cpp", "xpcom/threads/nsProcessCommon.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "09c165cf667385dde0d4b1293a2fc264dc5f6906", "parents": ["39573a76dadbeafd8e647f6cd58a9c18bdf93e07"], "tags": []}], "date": 1577957976, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "711": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr68 repo-update HSTS HPKP remote-settings - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D58515", "files": ["services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "100eaa275c9497e011c4da01d95e77ea3b7aeeec", "parents": ["d9cb7f05d441bd1b2a57f4200da5c402687985d8"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Geoff Brown \u003cgbrown@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1580036 - Verify that xpcshell plugins directory created; r=bc, a=test-only\n\nAdd simple wait-and-retry logic for the plugins directory creation, in hopes\nof addressing low frequency intermittent failures. Add logging too, so that\nthere will be more information if this does not work.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D47840", "files": ["testing/xpcshell/runxpcshelltests.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f4d99a85965072e5947ccee9b65319a8549a9dc8", "parents": ["100eaa275c9497e011c4da01d95e77ea3b7aeeec"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Tom Prince \u003cmozilla@hocat.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1604928: Increase docker-image load timeout; r=Callek, a=release\n\nrequests-unixsocket has a default timeout that is too large to reliably\nload the larger docker-images we have. Double the timeout to enable\nimages to build reliably.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D58149", "files": ["taskcluster/taskgraph/util/docker.py"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "54676ee974335201c644074a12fa99df9a604a3c", "parents": ["f4d99a85965072e5947ccee9b65319a8549a9dc8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1577975486, "git_changesets": [null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "712": {"changesets": [{"author": "Tom Prince \u003cmozilla@hocat.ca\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1606869: Switch decision task docker caches to match the rest the in-tree caches; r=Callek a=tomprince\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D58638", "files": [".taskcluster.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "39472a19eeba64078de4d1febab89d613605e9b0", "parents": ["54676ee974335201c644074a12fa99df9a604a3c"], "tags": []}], "date": 1578091537, "git_changesets": [