"author": "Andreas Pehrson \u003capehrson@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1392945 - Wait for \"seeked\" instead of \"playing\". r=alwu, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D55952", "files": ["dom/media/test/test_mediarecorder_playback_can_repeat.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "33ca4f77e03de140fcda0bc53fcb60fb94935555", "parents": ["4ad55bf7805230fb2cb7dd0932b19131720fc7b4"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alastor Wu \u003calwu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1601877 - Part 1: Modify test to await-based format. r=pehrsons, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D56819", "files": ["dom/media/test/test_mediarecorder_playback_can_repeat.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "3a2605c66013bb685bd19c765370b7edb6473cce", "parents": ["33ca4f77e03de140fcda0bc53fcb60fb94935555"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Alastor Wu \u003calwu@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1601877 - Part 2: Add check for 'playing' and 'seeking'. r=pehrsons, a=test-only\n\nAdd more log to see (1) if media start playing and (2) if seeking starts, in order to get more information to solve the intermittent failure.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D57174", "files": ["dom/media/test/test_mediarecorder_playback_can_repeat.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "ae55cf6614e111daec3b6be6be03e704e4f8ff54", "parents": ["3a2605c66013bb685bd19c765370b7edb6473cce"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Petru Lingurar \u003cpetru.lingurar@softvision.ro\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1603275 - Add a new FirefoxPromoBannerRow for the awesomescreen. r=VladBaicu, a=RyanVM\n\nThis new banner will not replace the old SignInRow (now FxaBannerRow) but\nrather take precendence into being shown on the awesomescreen.\nIt will only be shown if\n- the app is the release version. Not for beta. Not for nightly.\n- the device has at least Android 5.0. The minsdk of Fenix.\n- user has not explicitly dismissed this banner.\n\nAlso consolidated some resources common to both banners.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D58427", "files": ["mobile/android/app/src/main/res/drawable/as_banner_background_rounded.xml", "mobile/android/app/src/main/res/drawable/as_signin_background_round.xml", "mobile/android/app/src/main/res/layout/activity_stream_fxa_banner.xml", "mobile/android/app/src/main/res/layout/activity_stream_promo_banner.xml", "mobile/android/app/src/main/res/layout/activity_stream_signin.xml", "mobile/android/app/src/main/res/values/bool.xml", "mobile/android/app/src/main/res/values/dimens.xml", "mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/AccountsHelper.java", "mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/activitystream/homepanel/ActivityStreamHomeFragment.java", "mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/activitystream/homepanel/ActivityStreamPanel.java", "mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/activitystream/homepanel/StreamRecyclerAdapter.java", "mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/activitystream/homepanel/stream/FirefoxPromoBannerRow.java", "mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/activitystream/homepanel/stream/FxaBannerRow.java", "mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/activitystream/homepanel/stream/SignInRow.java"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "e8a29ea8972ca5882b5971161dfd468105f58e9c", "parents": ["ae55cf6614e111daec3b6be6be03e704e4f8ff54"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Petru Lingurar \u003cpetru.lingurar@softvision.ro\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1603275 - Remove unused strings Lint suppression. r=VladBaicu, a=RyanVM\n\nThe necessary strings have been added in previous patches in an effort to give\nlocalizers more time to translate them.\nNow that we are actually using this resources there's no need for the Lint\nsuppression anymore.\n\nDepends on D58427\n\nDifferential Revisi