ts/mochitest/events/docload/test_docload_root.html: Wait for focus event after opening the dialog. r=MarcoZ, a=test-only\n\nPreviously, when opening the dialog, we only waited for a reorder event.\nThis could mean we programmatically closed the dialog before it was ever focused.\nThat in turn would mean that focus would never be fired on the previous window when the dialog was closed, causing the close dialog test to time out.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D59826", "files": ["accessible/tests/mochitest/events/docload/test_docload_root.html"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f182cdc7247a58b57ebd7fd202a703e51b7df1da", "parents": ["7d85cbdd3ea34c2d5b940c92387699eea3901ace"], "tags": []}], "date": 1579103076, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "770": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\nes-AR -\u003e 3a9e05e85d28\nfr -\u003e 6f018a93c176\nhr -\u003e ca2419555db7\nit -\u003e 8c864883f633\nko -\u003e 3c36644b1de0\nnn-NO -\u003e f271d80c7843\npa-IN -\u003e 37d7df2aa94d\npt-BR -\u003e d2c3f9ad601a\nro -\u003e 9ee5798c22ab", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "a917dc818e2f0ef216160d009bc7ec31c0576923", "parents": ["f182cdc7247a58b57ebd7fd202a703e51b7df1da"], "tags": []}], "date": 1579172135, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "771": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\npa-IN -\u003e e6725a9825cc", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "aa17f26e68f84bca6db8a7d9d81f2b9e4ffc34af", "parents": ["a917dc818e2f0ef216160d009bc7ec31c0576923"], "