nBug 1607937 - Fix Eslint. CLOSED TREE", "files": ["browser/base/content/browser-addons.js", "browser/components/enterprisepolicies/tests/browser/browser_policy_extensionsettings.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f07a4c882511e061c55c4c25e760f9baa04cc34b", "parents": ["b25bc5d633fed949bacc5685d9414d977bf4b827"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Masayuki Nakano \u003cmasayuki@d-toybox.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1583135 - Disable scroll-anchoring at all editable elements r=emilio a=RyanVM\n\nThis patch disables scroll-anchoring of all editable elements including editable\nand scrollable elements in editing host because users don't want to scroll down\nwhen they insert new line and new line can be in the scrolled area.\n\nUnfortunately, the bug is not reproducible with simple testcase with\nsynthesized keyboard events.  Therefore, this patch does not include automated\ntests.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D60098", "files": ["layout/style/contenteditable.css"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7488b68d7b5b2ca17313a3d9c84a5a35ba9dfa7f", "parents": ["f07a4c882511e061c55c4c25e760f9baa04cc34b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1579657012, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "794": {"changesets": [{"author": "Sebastian Hengst \u003carchaeopteryx@coole-files.de\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Merge e215d711213984716b1c44db7d1254397de6ef4b to THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH. a=merge", "files": [], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null, null], "node": "72c76e9254c508cf56e07c55fccba0a85a9928af", "parents": ["5c3329fb2b7d52fa06d00b6b1b384b0ef7c4a279", "e215d711213984716b1c44db7d1254397de6ef4b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1579685121, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "795": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec 