e GMP fallback downloader for Widevine to reference the 4.10.1582.2\nCDM. This keeps the fallback URLs in step with Balrog.\n\nAdd an alias for `Linux_x86_64-gcc3-asan` to `Linux_x86_64-gcc3`. This alias\nexists in the Balrog rules already. This covers the case where the fallback is\nneeded for such asan builds.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D57725", "files": ["toolkit/content/gmp-sources/widevinecdm.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6e380e9e61a1c5f5bf26db7134d5c6e024a65741", "parents": ["bfbf484ecbccdf60a2b265e67db3012982a88868"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan-Ivar Bruaroey \u003cjib@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1598543 - Use size instead of length. r=dminor, a=jcristau\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D58144", "files": ["dom/media/systemservices/video_engine/desktop_capture_impl.cc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f754db38b851b49fdb08312e8e929e8f0793f6ee", "parents": ["6e380e9e61a1c5f5bf26db7134d5c6e024a65741"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Jan-Ivar Bruaroey \u003cjib@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1598543 - Cleanup upstream constants to also use size instead of length. r=dminor, a=jcristau\n\nDepends on D58144\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D58157", "files": ["dom/media/systemservices/video_engine/browser_capture_impl.h", "media/webrtc/trunk/webrtc/modules/video_capture/android/video_capture_android.cc", "media/webrtc/trunk/webrtc/modules/video_capture/linux/device_info_linux.cc", "media/webrtc/trunk/webrtc/modules/video_capture/linux/device_info_linux.h", "media/webrtc/trunk/webrtc/modules/video_capture/objc/video_capture.mm", "media/webrtc/trunk/webrtc/modules/video_capture/video_capture.h", "media/webrtc/trunk/webrtc/modules/video_capture/video_capture_defines.h", "media/webrtc/trunk/webrtc/modules/video_capture/windows/device_info_ds.cc", "media/webrtc/trunk/webrtc/modules/video_capture/windows/video_capture_ds.cc"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "231b92b1db0a354ac3f6356c1fad1342711580c1", "parents": ["f754db38b851b49fdb08312e8e929e8f0793f6ee"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Petru Lingurar \u003cpetru.lingurar@softvision.ro\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1610873 - Check for null before calling instance methods; r=VladBaicu, a=jcristau\n\n\"mRecentTabsAdapter\" could indeed be null in \"onDestroyView()\" if it's\ninitialization was skipped because of \"isParentFinishing()\".\nGuarding instance method calls with a null check is all we need here.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D60707", "files": ["mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/home/CombinedHistoryPanel.java"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "fac95027fda1540460a05a2f6b05210a14e60293", "parents": ["231b92b1db0a354ac3f6356c1fad1342711580c1"], "tags": ["FENNEC_68_5b6_BUILD1", "FENNEC_68_5b6_RELEASE"]}], "date": 1580311569, "git_changesets": [null, null, null, null, null], "user": "jcristau@mozilla.com"}, "825": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\nar -\u003e 2586b90cb5e0\nbn -\u003e 84e521dadf63\nbr -\u003e d1a394931fb5\nca -\u003e 954498ded8a6\nde -\u003e 4b0e22790445\net -\u003e 91f76e6a59f2\nfr -\u003e b34bbddbb770\nis -\u003e 8b558c9c2b21\nkk -\u003e 4018b2fc6459\nko -\u003e 3d8f6150e9c8\noc -\u003e b73cf1adb845\npt-BR -\u003e ae66028c2abb\npt-PT -\u003e 153576a2c335\nsk -\u003e 98cc5ae04cfb\nsr -\u003e 43c45713d235", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cb6d27646603a1205355f974ca6addb61e4c01b3", "parents": ["fac95027fda1540460a05a2f6b05210a14e60293"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580367282, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "826": {"changesets": [{"author": "Kai Engert \u003ckaie@kuix.de\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "Bug 1606619 - Fix Firefox CVE-2018-12383 in Thunderbird, cleanup key3.db if migration is known to have succeeded. r=mkmelin,emk a=mkmelin\nAlso includes ported fix from bug 1607652 for correct key3.db cleanup on Windows. r=emk", "files": ["security/manager/ssl/SecretDecoderRing.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "661669a9175b755a43bde8a1a6594cd93f3f75df", "parents": ["72c76e9254c508cf56e07c55fccba0a85a9928af"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580395270, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "827": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "no bug - Bumping Fennec l10n changesets r=release a=l10n-bump DONTBUILD\n\nid -\u003e c9ef7b056d52\nit -\u003e e1dd567a0a1e\nur -\u003e 438ff72c279e", "files": ["mobile/locales/l10n-changesets.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5b60ba8829c01de0197b4154a5bc8b89e01defbc", "parents": ["cb6d27646603a1205355f974ca6addb61e4c01b3"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580396143, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "828": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging fac95027fda1540460a05a2f6b05210a14e60293 with FENNEC_68_5b6_BUILD1 a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "07cc0b13fee612d1b6a4113f82a2d306d517b608", "parents": ["5b60ba8829c01de0197b4154a5bc8b89e01defbc"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580703202, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "829": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging fac95027fda1540460a05a2f6b05210a14e60293 with FENNEC_68_5b6_RELEASE a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "1c3cc960ff5120541f2b42fe7dfd5e951b841d16", "parents": ["07cc0b13fee612d1b6a4113f82a2d306d517b608"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Automatic version bump CLOSED TREE NO BUG a=release DONTBUILD", "files": ["mobile/android/config/version-files/beta/version_display.txt"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "773a37b9a3e39f3a14c61d7ff027629f9038cc0f", "parents": ["1c3cc960ff5120541f2b42fe7dfd5e951b841d16"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580744351, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "830": {"changesets": [{"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr68 repo-update blocklist remote-settings tld-suffixes - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D61463", "files": ["browser/app/blocklist.xml", "netwerk/dns/effective_tld_names.dat", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "56bc92dee75e5cc7b8298abd96fc603828519579", "parents": ["773a37b9a3e39f3a14c61d7ff027629f9038cc0f"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Marco Bonardo \u003cmbonardo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1607902 - Fix Sqlite VFS zName parsing for Sqlite versions \u003e= 3.31.0. r=asuth, a=RyanVM\n\nSqlite 3.31.0 changed the zName layout, breaking our custom parsing of it.\nDue to this the VFS started crashing on Sqlite library upgrade.\n\nThis fixes the parser, but only for Firefox versions it can be uplifted to,\nwe can't fix versions already released, that may start crashing once system\nSqlite gets updated to a newer version.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D60952", "files": ["storage/TelemetryVFS.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "d545e6e91173b42bea7e4e5b0f59815ece4747d5", "parents": ["56bc92dee75e5cc7b8298abd96fc603828519579"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mihai Tabara \u003cmtabara@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1605073 - Automatically ship Fennec beta releases. r=jlund, a=RyanVM\n\nShip instead of promoting for automated betas Fennec\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D60399", "files": ["taskcluster/ci/maybe-release/kind.yml"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9c848bed922ed4ad7eeb4ed15a25f93014a6acc9", "parents": ["d545e6e91173b42bea7e4e5b0f59815ece4747d5"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580745613, "git_changesets": [null, null, null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "831": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003cryanvm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1607902 - Bustage fix. r=mak, a=bustage", "files": ["storage/TelemetryVFS.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "0ff508fe674be76d2bc7af92c9951311e9b2b930", "parents": ["9c848bed922ed4ad7eeb4ed15a25f93014a6acc9"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580748461, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "832": {"changesets": [{"author": "Ryan VanderMeulen \u003cryanvm@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Backed out changesets 0ff508fe674b and d545e6e91173 (bug 1607902) for various test failures.", "files": ["storage/TelemetryVFS.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "6168a78b9dd7cd1ea26eb52c362e72ad93572eaf", "parents": ["0ff508fe674be76d2bc7af92c9951311e9b2b930"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580752099, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "833": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jeff Walden \u003cjwalden@mit.edu\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1596706.  r=tcampbell a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D59963", "files": ["js/src/frontend/BytecodeCompiler.cpp", "js/src/frontend/Parser.cpp", "js/src/frontend/Parser.h", "js/src/frontend/TokenStream.cpp", "js/src/frontend/TokenStream.h"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "18251ad24c9a3b89c42d4098b64e71f54a1e4586", "parents": ["6168a78b9dd7cd1ea26eb52c362e72ad93572eaf"], "tags": ["FENNEC_68_5_0_BUILD1", "FIREFOX_68_5_0esr_BUILD1"]}], "date": 1580758872, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ryanvm@gmail.com"}, "834": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 18251ad24c9a3b89c42d4098b64e71f54a1e4586 with FIREFOX_68_5_0esr_BUILD1 a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "68114ccd40aa31b83eaa404b98ec59ea16511a21", "parents": ["18251ad24c9a3b89c42d4098b64e71f54a1e4586"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580770844, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "835": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 18251ad24c9a3b89c42d4098b64e71f54a1e4586 with FENNEC_68_5_0_BUILD1 a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "49140c5c67bd2fb56cbc89680427f35c53e849ba", "parents": ["68114ccd40aa31b83eaa404b98ec59ea16511a21"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580771144, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "836": {"changesets": [{"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No bug - Tagging 18251ad24c9a3b89c42d4098b64e71f54a1e4586 with FENNEC_68_5_0_RELEASE a=release CLOSED TREE DONTBUILD", "files": [".hgtags"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "f938c4bc86bf1a13515fd6315e1f75ba835df3b8", "parents": ["49140c5c67bd2fb56cbc89680427f35c53e849ba"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Mozilla Releng Treescript \u003crelease+treescript@mozilla.org\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Automatic version bump CLOSED TREE NO BUG a=release DONTBUILD", "files": ["mobile/android/config/version-files/release/version.txt", "mobile/android/config/version-files/release/version_display.txt"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "c20e276547e070e17f9dbb195f953e2606f8288a", "parents": ["f938c4bc86bf1a13515fd6315e1f75ba835df3b8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580832394, "git_changesets": [null, null], "user": "ffxbld"}, "837": {"changesets": [{"author": "J.C. Jones \u003cjjones@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1613275 - Regenerate expired certs not handled by Bug 1607845 a=RyanVM CLOSED TREE\n\ncommands:\n\nopenssl x509 -in security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_missing_intermediate/missing-intermediate.pem -outform der -out security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_missing_intermediate/missing-intermediate.der\n\nmach python ./build/pgo/genpgocert.py\n\n./mach python ./security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/pycert.py \u003csecurity/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_certDB_import/emailEE.pem.certspec \u003esecurity/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_certDB_import/emailEE.pem\n./mach python ./security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/pycert.py \u003csecurity/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_certDB_import/importedCA.pem.certspec \u003esecurity/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_certDB_import/importedCA.pem\n./mach python ./security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/pycert.py \u003csecurity/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_intermediate_preloads/ee.pem.certspec \u003esecurity/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_intermediate_preloads/ee.pem\n./mach python ./security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/pycert.py \u003csecurity/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_intermediate_preloads/ee2.pem.certspec \u003esecurity/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_intermediate_preloads/ee2.pem\n./mach python ./security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/pycert.py \u003csecurity/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_intermediate_preloads/int.pem.certspec \u003esecurity/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_intermediate_preloads/int.pem\n./mach python ./security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/pycert.py \u003csecurity/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_intermediate_preloads/int2.pem.certspec \u003esecurity/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_intermediate_preloads/int2.pem\n\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D61653", "files": ["build/pgo/certs/cert9.db", "build/pgo/certs/key4.db", "build/pgo/certs/mochitest.client", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_certDB_import/emailEE.pem", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_certDB_import/importedCA.pem", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_intermediate_preloads/ee.pem", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_intermediate_preloads/ee2.pem", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_intermediate_preloads/int.pem", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_intermediate_preloads/int2.pem", "security/manager/ssl/tests/unit/test_missing_intermediate/missing-intermediate.der"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "9286836fedf00b468e99cc8fe62b08ef0a458ef9", "parents": ["c20e276547e070e17f9dbb195f953e2606f8288a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580884686, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "rmaries@mozilla.com"}, "838": {"changesets": [{"author": "Marco Bonardo \u003cmbonardo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1607902 - Fix Sqlite VFS zName parsing for Sqlite versions \u003e= 3.31.0 (uplift only patch). r=asuth a=RyanVM\n\n\n\nSqlite 3.31.0 changed the zName layout, breaking our custom parsing of it.\nDue to this the VFS started crashing on Sqlite library upgrade.\n\nThis fixes the parser, but only for Firefox versions it can be uplifted to,\nwe can't fix versions already released, that may start crashing once system\nSqlite gets updated to a newer version.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com//D60952", "files": ["storage/TelemetryVFS.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "42c51f5a5fb406f0dbb91a718424b914d4da912b", "parents": ["9286836fedf00b468e99cc8fe62b08ef0a458ef9"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580915323, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "apavel@mozilla.com"}, "839": {"changesets": [{"author": "Sebastian Hengst \u003carchaeopteryx@coole-files.de\u003e", "branch": "THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH", "desc": "merge mozilla-esr68 default branch to THUNDERBIRD_68_VERBRANCH. a=merge", "files": ["browser/config/version.txt", "browser/config/version_display.txt", "config/milestone.txt", "mobile/android/app/src/main/res/drawable/as_signin_background_round.xml", "mobile/android/app/src/main/res/layout/activity_stream_signin.xml", "mobile/android/base/java/org/mozilla/gecko/activitystream/homepanel/stream/SignInRow.java", "mobile/android/config/version-files/release/version.txt", "mobile/android/config/version-files/release/version_display.txt"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null, null], "node": "adc498831718f05359ea4715125d899458de9024", "parents": ["661669a9175b755a43bde8a1a6594cd93f3f75df", "42c51f5a5fb406f0dbb91a718424b914d4da912b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1580985909, "git_changesets": [null], "user": "archaeopteryx@coole-files.de"}, "840": {"changesets": [{"author": "Andrei Oprea \u003candrei.br92@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1524810 - Intermittent browser/components/newtab/test/browser/browser_asrouter_targeting.js. r=k88hudson, a=test-only\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D60541", "files": ["browser/components/newtab/test/browser/browser_asrouter_targeting.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "5bba9e53cf6c62677dfbcb697e96fe5ed0b37cac", "parents": ["42c51f5a5fb406f0dbb91a718424b914d4da912b"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Rob Wu \u003crob@robwu.nl\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1464451 - Fix intermittent failure in browser_ext_pageAction_context.js. r=rpl, a=test-only\n\nThere is no guarantee that a tab has finished loading when the test\nresumes. As a result, it is possible for the page action's visibility\nstate to reset (to invisible) between calling `pageAction.show()` and\n`pageAction.isShown()`. To prevent that from happening, wait until the\ntab has finished loading before resuming the test.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D61125", "files": ["browser/components/extensions/test/browser/browser_ext_pageAction_context.js"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "7348b8605b7184a84bbcf06b3bf27846f74977ee", "parents": ["5bba9e53cf6c62677dfbcb697e96fe5ed0b37cac"], "tags": []}, {"author": "ffxbld \u003cffxbld@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "No Bug, mozilla-esr68 repo-update blocklist remote-settings - a=repo-update r=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D61819", "files": ["browser/app/blocklist.xml", "services/settings/dumps/blocklists/addons.json", "services/settings/dumps/security-state/intermediates.json"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "b4414f6af6fd0a4b816f9612ad43e67473a13775", "parents": ["7348b8605b7184a84bbcf06b3bf27846f74977ee"], "tags": []}, {"author": "sotaro \u003csotaro.ikeda.g@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1605777 - Clear WrappingTextureSourceYCbCrBasic::mTexture correctly. r=nical, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D60639", "files": ["gfx/layers/composite/TextureHost.cpp"], "git_node": null, "git_parents": [null], "node": "cd274ad7d7bf78c4371659db5e94c6f0ca0ebd35", "parents": ["b4414f6af6fd0a4b816f9612ad43e67473a13775"], "tags": []}, {"author": "Ksenia Berezina \u003ckberezina@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 1612909 - Import WebCompat GoFaster 7.0.0 sources. r=miketaylr, a=RyanVM\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D61499", "files": ["browser/extensions/webcompat/about-compat/aboutCompat.css", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/injections.js", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/picture_in_picture_overrides.js", "browser/extensions/webcompat/data/ua_overrides.js", "browser/extensions/webcompat/experiment-apis/pictureInPicture.js", "browser/extensions/webcompat/experiment-apis/pictureInPicture.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/experiment-apis/systemManufacturer.js", "browser/extensions/webcompat/experiment-apis/systemManufacturer.json", "browser/extensions/webcompat/inject